<title>USA: Bluegreen CFO Alan Murray resigns.</title>
<headline>Bluegreen CFO Alan Murray resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bluegreen Corp said on Friday Alan Murray has resigned in all capacities with the company, including his position as treasurer and chief financial officer, to pursue other personal interests.</p>
</text>
